.Sh HISTORY
Wattle began as a fork of Janet,
the language created by Calvin Rose.
.Pp
Wattle has its own version numbering.
Releases follow the
.Ql "<major>\&.<minor>\&.<patch>"
numbering pattern.
Development versions use
.Ql "DEVEL-<commit-hash>" .
.Ql "-dirty"
is appended when a tracked file differs from the commit.
.Pp
The version number is available within Wattle at
.Ql "wattle/version" .
.
